# Beyond Infinity, Qu'Bia Arena (battlefield.beyond_infinity): main registers and invites bob (accepted, clasp), cat
# (accepted, no clasp), dan (completed, no clasp) and eve (available, no clasp). Only the registrant needs the
# clasp: bob, cat and dan enter, eve gets no options. Atori-Tutori killed: the win for the party, each finish.
lists QubiaArena/BC_Entrance/onTrigger QubiaArena/onEventUpdate/32000 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32000 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WAR lvl=75
